.TH kannadi-to-unicode 1  "to-unicode 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
kannadi\-to\-unicode \- Convert documents in legacy Kannada fonts to Unicode
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkannadi to\-unicode\fR [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-\-layout\fR] [\fB\-\-kannada\-digits\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\-zeros\fR] [\fB\-\-font\fR] [\fB\-\-legacy\-font\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> <\fIINPUTS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert documents in legacy Kannada fonts to Unicode
.PP
Reads TXT, HTML, DOCX and PDF files. Text in HTML, DOCX and PDF files is converted only where it is set in a legacy font. The text of a PDF goes to NAME.pdf.txt.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Folder to write the converted files and reports to
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Exit with status 1 if any file has unknown glyphs, malformed syllables or unencodable characters; likely typos do not count
.TP
\fB\-\-layout\fR \fI<LAYOUT>\fR [default: nudi]
Layout of text files, and of fonts added with \-\-legacy\-font that name none. nudi covers the Nudi and Baraha ANSI fonts
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
nudi
.IP \(bu 2
akruti
.IP \(bu 2
shree\-lipi
.IP \(bu 2
nudi\-b
.IP \(bu 2
kan\-eng
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-kannada\-digits\fR
Write digits as Kannada digits, for text set in the k variants of the Nudi fonts
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-zeros\fR
Keep a zero typed between letters as a digit; by default it becomes ಂ
.TP
\fB\-\-font\fR \fI<NAME>\fR [default: Noto Sans Kannada]
Font to set converted text in, in HTML and DOCX files
.TP
\fB\-\-legacy\-font\fR \fI<NAME[=LAYOUT]>\fR
Treat this font as a legacy font too, in the layout after `=` ("My Font=akruti") or else the \-\-layout one. Repeat for more fonts
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUTS\fR>
Files and folders to convert. Folders are searched for .txt, .htm, .html, .docx and .pdf files
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  kannadi to\-unicode old\-orders/ \-\-out converted/
  kannadi to\-unicode notes.txt \-\-layout akruti \-\-out converted/
  kannadi to\-unicode page.html \-\-legacy\-font "My Font=akruti" \-\-out converted/

Exit status:
  0  Success. Reports may still list problems and likely typos.
  1  \-\-strict was given and a file has a problem.
  2  Bad arguments, or a file that could not be read, converted or written.
     2 wins over 1 when both apply.
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.1
